__suksa__ |~np~ x1 is sudden it stage x2 in process x3 ~/np~|~np~ x1 (event/state) is sudden/sharply changes at stage/point x2 in process/property/function x3. ~/np~
__sumji__ |~np~ x1 is the sum of x2 plus x3 ~/np~|~np~ x1 is a mathematical sum/result/total of x2 plus/increased by x3. ~/np~
__sumne__ |~np~  ~/np~|~np~ x1 (experiencer) smells/scents (transitive verb) x2; x2 smells/has odor/scent to observer x1. ~/np~
__sumti__ |~np~ x1 is an argument of predicate x2 filling place x3 ~/np~|~np~ x1 is a/the argument of predicate/function x2 filling place x3 (kind/number). ~/np~
__sunga__ |~np~  ~/np~|~np~ x1 is a quantity of garlic [bulb] of species/strain x2. ~/np~
__sunla__ |~np~  ~/np~|~np~ x1 is a quantity of/made from/consists of wool [tight curly hair] from animal/species/source x2. ~/np~
